@engineering.kiss

Purpose:
  Keep it simple.

Owns: references\engineering\kiss.sdd
UseWhen:
  - solution can be simple
  - readability matters
  - maintenance cost is high

AvoidWhen:
  - complexity is required for correctness
  - performance demands optimization

Why:
  Simple solutions are easier to understand, test, and maintain.

Exception:
  If simplicity sacrifices measurable business or technical value, complexity is justified.

Related:
  @engineering.dry
  @engineering.yagni

Examples:
  @project.simple-crud
  @project.admin-panel

State: +
